<h3 data-start="137" data-end="180"><strong data-start="141" data-end="178">Digital Standee I-Shape – 50 Inch</strong></h3>
<p data-start="181" data-end="229"><strong data-start="181" data-end="229">Large Indoor Display for High-Impact Visuals</strong></p>
<p data-start="231" data-end="540">The <strong data-start="235" data-end="285">Beneicon Pixel Digital Standee I-Shape 50 Inch</strong> is a freestanding indoor display designed for offices, retail stores, exhibitions, and showrooms. Its I-shape structure provides stability and a modern aesthetic, while the 50-inch screen delivers bright, sharp, and engaging visuals for maximum impact.</p>
<p data-start="542" data-end="561"><strong data-start="542" data-end="559">Key Features:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="562" data-end="1050">
<li data-start="562" data-end="656">
<p data-start="564" data-end="656"><strong data-start="564" data-end="591">50-Inch Full HD Screen:</strong> Offers clear, high-resolution visuals for indoor applications.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="657" data-end="749">
<p data-start="659" data-end="749"><strong data-start="659" data-end="691">I-Shape Freestanding Design:</strong> Stylish and stable, suitable for various indoor setups.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="750" data-end="846">
<p data-start="752" data-end="846"><strong data-start="752" data-end="783">Portable &amp; Easy to Install:</strong> Lightweight design allows effortless movement and placement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="847" data-end="939">
<p data-start="849" data-end="939"><strong data-start="849" data-end="877">User-Friendly Interface:</strong> Supports video, images, and promotional content seamlessly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="940" data-end="1050">
<p data-start="942" data-end="1050"><strong data-start="942" data-end="963">Energy Efficient:</strong> Optimized LED technology ensures low power consumption while maintaining brightness.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1052" data-end="1083"><strong data-start="1052" data-end="1081">Technical Specifications:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1084" data-end="1270">
<li data-start="1084" data-end="1112">
<p data-start="1086" data-end="1112"><strong data-start="1086" data-end="1102">Screen Size:</strong> 50 Inch</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1113" data-end="1152">
<p data-start="1115" data-end="1152"><strong data-start="1115" data-end="1130">Resolution:</strong> Full HD / 1920&#215;1080</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1153" data-end="1183">
<p data-start="1155" data-end="1183"><strong data-start="1155" data-end="1170">Brightness:</strong> ≥ 500 nits</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1184" data-end="1226">
<p data-start="1186" data-end="1226"><strong data-start="1186" data-end="1204">Viewing Angle:</strong> 160° (H) / 140° (V)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1227" data-end="1270">
<p data-start="1229" data-end="1270"><strong data-start="1229" data-end="1255">Operating Temperature:</strong> 0°C to +40°C</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1272" data-end="1363"><strong data-start="1272" data-end="1289">Applications:</strong><br data-start="1289" data-end="1292" />Retail Stores • Offices • Exhibitions • Showrooms • Indoor Promotions</p>
<p data-start="1365" data-end="1504"><strong data-start="1365" data-end="1504">Deliver large, high-quality indoor visuals with Beneicon Pixel Digital Standee I-Shape 50 Inch — sleek, stable, and attention-grabbing.</strong></p>

					</div>
