										<div id="text-3" class="widget widget_text"><h5>Know more about us</h5>			<div class="textwidget"></div>
		</div><div id="block-41" class="widget widget_block widget_text">
<p class="has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-c645e628e62f8fbab9d9726851472d16"></p>
</div><div id="block-63" class="widget widget_block widget_text">
<p class="has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-fc64f4695c49984854894b2d84bd9599"><strong>Beneicon</strong> is a premium LED display and visual solutions brand, <strong>manufactured and powered by Beneicon Pixel LLP</strong>, one of India’s trusted manufacturers and system integrators in the audio-visual industry. We specialize in delivering <strong>high-performance LED video walls, digital display systems, interactive signage, and complete end-to-end audio-visual integration solutions</strong> designed to inspire, engage, and perform in real-world environments.</p>
</div><div id="block-64" class="widget widget_block widget_text">
<p class="has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-23ee39580ea1778d2af67ced07257538">Backed by the manufacturing excellence, engineering expertise, and Pan-India project experience of Beneicon Pixel LLP, Beneicon delivers <strong>reliable, innovative, and precision-engineered AV solutions</strong> for a wide range of applications. Our solutions are trusted across <strong>corporate offices, retail and hospitality spaces, government and public sector projects, control rooms and command centers, exhibitions, live events, and large-scale outdoor installations</strong>.</p>
</div><div id="block-65" class="widget widget_block widget_text">
<p class="has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4eae5ce74252f922cf6c6074210d7441">From design and manufacturing to seamless installation and dedicated after-sales support, every Beneicon solution is built with a strong focus on <strong>quality, durability, visual clarity, and long-term performance</strong>. By combining advanced technology with a client-first approach, we help brands, businesses, and institutions transform spaces into powerful visual communication experiences.</p>
</div><div id="block-66" class="widget widget_block widget_text">
<p class="has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-037baccbc4476581cef6c0c2e5f83abe"><strong>Beneicon — engineered for impact, built for trust.</strong></p>
</div><div id="block-51" class="widget widget_block">
<div style="height:49px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
</div><div id="block-45" class="widget widget_block">
<div class="wp-block-qi-blocks-button qodef-block-container qodef-widget-block-528e7dfd"><a class="qi-block-button qodef-block qodef-m qodef-layout--filled qodef-type--standard qodef-hover--icon-move-horizontal-short" href="https://beneiconpixel.com/about-us/"><span class="qodef-m-text">Know more</span></a></div>
</div><div id="block-52" class="widget widget_block">
<div style="height:57px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
</div><div id="block-50" class="widget widget_block">
